OL,3,GNEWSAFurther arrest after taxi driver  
OL,4,Ashot dead in 1994                      
OL,6,FPolice investigating the murder of a   
OL,7,Ftaxi driver who was shot dead in his   
OL,8,Fcab nearly 32 years ago have made      
OL,9,Fanother arrest.                        
OL,11,FEthsham Ul-Haq Ghafoor - who was known 
OL,12,Fto his family and friends as Shami -   
OL,13,Fwas found shot dead with his hands tied
OL,14,Fand bound to the steering wheel in the 
OL,15,Fearly hours of 22 November 1994.       
OL,17,FThe 26-year-old was discovered by a    
OL,18,Fmilkman at Lambley Lane Playing Fields 
OL,19,Fin Gedling, Nottinghamshire, at about  
OL,20,F04:30 GMT.                             
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
