OL,3,GNEWSAFurther arrest after taxi driver  
OL,4,Ashot dead in 1994                      
OL,6,FNottinghamshire Police has issued      
OL,7,Fseveral appeals over the case and on   
OL,8,FFriday, confirmed a 62-year-old man had
OL,9,Fbeen arrested in the Broxtowe area on  
OL,10,FMonday. He has been released on bail   
OL,11,Fwhile investigations continue.         
